Tree Realm (sdbf)
Maintainer: PhantomRain
License: GPL-3.0-only

The tree terrain and structure algorithms, templates and associated datapack
resources were adapted from the supplied SlashBlade-SenDims workspace and
sdbf datapack. Original world generation package:
com.tonywww.slashblade_sendims.worldgen

The supplied reference sources and their original notices remain under raw/.
This project extracts only the tree realm and replaces external materials,
entities and loot for standalone testing. It does not bundle other mods.
